RELAXED_BOX 71.8569705994903 71.8909319733522 71.8735770066855

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-86.7816244965818)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-86.7816244965818)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
